  <blockquote cite="https://srvo.github.io/anthropic-pbc/">
    <p>the law gives directors no duty to any person on account of the purpose, and only holders of 2% (once listed, the lesser of 2% and $2 million) may sue to enforce it; the public the charter names cannot.</p>
